<!-- Testimonials Section -->
<section class="testimonials section-pad">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Verified Customer Reviews</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Real Men, <em>Real Results</em></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Every review is from a verified Cash on Delivery order — real customers, real results.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonials-grid" style="margin-top:40px;">

      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars">
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="review-quote">
          "I was tired all the time and my confidence was low. A friend recommended Midnight Drive. After just a few days I felt more energy and warmth. My wife also noticed the change. 4 drops is all it takes. Best purchase I made this year."
        </p>
        <div>
          <p class="review-author-name">Taimoor Shah</p>
          <p class="review-author-location">DHA Phase 6, Lahore</p>
          <p class="review-verified">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            Verified COD Order · 2 days ago
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars">
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="review-quote">
          "Got it delivered in Islamabad in 48 hours — completely plain box, no branding at all. The oil itself smells amazing and you feel the warmth within minutes of applying. Tried many other products before. Nothing worked like this. Highly recommended for every married man."
        </p>
        <div>
          <p class="review-author-name">Dr. Kamran A.</p>
          <p class="review-author-location">F-10, Islamabad</p>
          <p class="review-verified">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            Verified COD Order · 1 week ago
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <article class="review-card">
        <div class="review-stars">
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
          <span class="review-star">★</span>
        </div>
        <p class="review-quote">
          "PKR 2,499 is totally worth it. The Clove and Raig Mahi really work — you feel warm and energetic right away. I have been using it for 6 weeks. My energy levels are better, my confidence is up, and my wife is happy. Plain packaging delivered to my door. Will order again."
        </p>
        <div>
          <p class="review-author-name">Saad M.</p>
          <p class="review-author-location">Clifton, Karachi</p>
          <p class="review-verified">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
